# Citytaxi Horw — Public Website (citytaxihorw.ch)

## Project Information
- **Project:** Citytaxi Horw – Public Frontend
- **Domain:** `citytaxihorw.ch`
- **Tech Stack:** Next.js 15 (App Router), TypeScript, styled-jsx (no Tailwind), Resend (email)
- **UI Language:** German (de-CH), Umlauts required in all user-facing text
- **Code comments:** English or Turkish

## Project Structure

```
src/
├── app/
│   ├── layout.tsx               → Root layout, global metadata, Navbar/Footer
│   ├── page.tsx                 → Homepage (SSG)
│   ├── booking/page.tsx         → Taxi bestellen (SSG + BookingForm)
│   ├── contact/page.tsx         → Kontakt (SSG + ContactClientPage)
│   ├── blog/page.tsx            → Blog listing (SSG)
│   ├── blog/[slug]/page.tsx     → Blog post (ISR, revalidate=3600)
│   ├── services/page.tsx        → Dienstleistungen (SSG)
│   ├── pricing/page.tsx         → Preise (SSG)
│   ├── about/page.tsx           → Über uns (SSG)
│   ├── api/booking/route.ts     → POST handler: validates + sends notifications
│   └── robots.ts / sitemap.ts
├── components/
│   ├── layout/                  → Navbar, Footer
│   ├── sections/                → Hero, BookingForm, ServiceCards, ...
│   └── ui/                      → AddressAutocompleteField, WhatsAppButton, ...
├── data/
│   ├── site.json                → Company info, contact, navigation, SEO defaults
│   └── pages/*.json             → Per-page content (home, booking, blog, ...)
├── lib/
│   └── booking-notifications.ts → Resend email helpers (server-side only)
└── styles/globals.css
```

## Content Rules

All user-facing copy lives in `src/data/`. **Never hardcode text in components.**

```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT
import bookingData from '@/data/pages/booking.json'
<label>{bookingData.form.pickup_label}</label>

// ❌ WRONG
<label>Abholort</label>
```

## Rendering Strategy

| Route | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `/` | SSG | Build-time |
| `/booking` | SSG | Build-time |
| `/blog` | SSG | Build-time |
| `/blog/[slug]` | ISR | `revalidate = 3600` |
| `/services`, `/pricing`, `/about`, `/contact` | SSG | Build-time |
| `/api/booking` | Route Handler | Server-side POST only |

## Critical Rules

```
❌ NEVER hardcode company info (phone, email, address) — use src/data/site.json
❌ NEVER commit .env.local or real API keys to git
❌ NEVER use <img> — always next/image with width+height or fill
❌ NEVER skip generateMetadata on any page
❌ NEVER import src/lib/booking-notifications.ts in a "use client" component
✅ ALWAYS use "use client" for components with useState/useEffect
✅ ALWAYS use styled-jsx for component styles (no Tailwind, no inline styles)
✅ ALWAYS add canonical URL in generateMetadata
```

## Environment Variables

```bash
NEXT_PUBLIC_DOMAIN=citytaxihorw.ch
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=...    # Client-safe: address autocomplete
RESEND_API_KEY=...                      # Server-only: booking emails
BOOKING_EMAIL_FROM="Citytaxi Horw <bookings@citytaxihorw.ch>"
BOOKING_EMAIL_DISPATCH=info@citytaxihorw.ch
BOOKING_WEBHOOK_URL=                    # Optional: Zapier/Make/Slack
SMTP_HOST=mail.hostpoint.ch             # Fallback SMTP
```

`NEXT_PUBLIC_` prefix = safe for client. All others = server-side only.

## Change Protocol

1. Change MAX 1–2 files per task
2. Run `npm run build` after changes, fix type errors immediately
3. Use `npm run build:fresh` if you see `Cannot find module '.XXX.js'`
4. Never modify `node_modules` or auto-generated files

## Error Fixing

```
1. ROOT CAUSE — is it server/client boundary? missing metadata? build cache?
2. MINIMAL CHANGE — only what is necessary
3. VERIFY — npm run build passes, no TypeScript errors
4. If other files need changes → say so, don't do it silently
```

## Common Issues

| Problem | Cause | Fix |
|---|---|---|
| `Cannot find module './XXX.js'` | Corrupt build cache | `npm run build:fresh` |
| Google Autocomplete not showing | API key not in `.env.local` or Maps JS/Places API disabled | Check Google Cloud Console |
| Autocomplete dropdown hidden by navbar | z-index | `.pac-container { z-index: 10050 !important }` already in globals.css |
| Email notifications not sent in prod | `RESEND_API_KEY` missing | Add to server environment |
| `[object Event]` in form | Event passed as error string | Use `safeApiErrorMessage()` in BookingForm.tsx |
